  "bio": "Lo, hailing from the creative pulse of Rocky Hill, United States, is a master of the avant-garde 'trashpolka' style, which can only be described as a harmonious cacophony inked into the skin. This artist's work is marked by an unwavering commitment to cleanliness, ensuring every piece is not only a visual spectacle but also created in a pristine and hygienic environment. Lo's portfolio is a testament to their dedication to both the art form and the wellbeing of their clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Rocky Hill, Connecticut, United States\n\nSIR LO | OWNER OF @TIMEOUTTATTOOS & @BEYONDXSELFISH\nDM ME TO WORK | TATTOOS, FOOD, ART N LO STUFF",
